<Slide style={{ padding: 48, background: '#ffffff' }}>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f172a', marginBottom: 8 }}>跨场景联动（有依赖的任务链）</Text>
  <Box style={{ width: 60, height: 5, background: '#1a73e8', borderRadius: 3, marginBottom: 24 }} />
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, marginBottom: 18 }}>
    {[
      '核验共同账单', '确认分摊规则', '资金预留/赎回', '到账后本人付款', '回执对账'
    ].map((x, i, arr) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, background: '#e8f0fe', border: '1px solid #1a73e8' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1a73e8' }}>{x}</Text>
        </Box>
        {i < arr.length - 1 && <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#94a3b8' }}>→</Text>}
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, background: '#f0f4f8', gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f172a' }}>异常处置支线</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        异常扣费 → 证据核验 → 本人选择<br /><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>订阅取消 / 卡片限制 / 挂失</span>
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, background: '#f0f4f8', gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f172a' }}>状态机约束</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        前一步<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#d93025' }}>真实状态约束后一步</span>；依赖失败→后序跳过；已执行只能生成补偿，不删流水。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
